  "segments": [
    {
      "id": 0,
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 3.62,
      "text": " A beautiful website doesn't automatically generate enquiries."
    },
    {
      "id": 1,
      "start": 3.96,
      "end": 9.74,
      "text": " The best performing venue websites are designed to guide couples towards taking action."
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "start": 10.72,
      "end": 21.5,
      "text": " Website Analyzer reviews your website against proven wedding venue conversion principles, showing you what's working, what's not and where the biggest opportunities exist."
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "start": 21.96,
      "end": 24.18,
      "text": " Simply enter your website address."
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "start": 24.68,
      "end": 29.74,
      "text": " Studio AI analyses your content, user experience, lead capture."
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "start": 30.0,
      "end": 34.72,
      "text": " Pricing transparency, trust signals and technical performance."
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "start": 35.86,
      "end": 43.22,
      "text": " Within minutes, you'll receive a complete website performance score, not a generic SEO audit."
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "start": 43.62,
      "end": 50.72,
      "text": " A venue-specific conversion review designed to help generate more enquiries, tours and bookings."
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "start": 51.76,
      "end": 58.52,
      "text": " The Executive Summary highlights your strengths, weaknesses and highest priority recommendations,"
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "start": 58.52,
      "end": 61.66,
      "text": " giving you a clear roadmap for improvement."
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "start": 63.44,
      "end": 71.64,
      "text": " Every recommendation is prioritised by impact, quick wins, medium effort improvements and strategic investments,"
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "start": 71.98,
      "end": 74.76,
      "text": " so you know exactly where to focus first."
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "start": 76.1,
      "end": 78.96,
      "text": " Not every issue carries the same weight."
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "start": 79.44,
      "end": 86.4,
      "text": " Studio AI helps you prioritise the changes most likely to increase enquiries, venue tours and bookings."
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "start": 86.76,
      "end": 94.06,
      "text": " Unlike generic website analysis tools, Studio AI evaluates your website across the areas that matter most."
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "start": 94.06,
      "end": 104.76,
      "text": " First impressions, mobile experience, pricing transparency, lead capture, trust and credibility, and the overall enquiry journey."
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "start": 106.02,
      "end": 112.6,
      "text": " Together, they create a complete picture of how effectively your website converts visitors into enquiries."
    },
    {
      "id": 17,
      "start": 112.6,
      "end": 115.54,
      "text": " Every score is backed by detailed analysis."
    },
    {
      "id": 18,
      "start": 116.12,
      "end": 122.22,
      "text": " Studio AI shows what it found, why it matters, and exactly what should be improved."
    },
    {
      "id": 19,
      "start": 123.44,
      "end": 133.32,
      "text": " Where appropriate, Studio AI can also identify opportunities where venue bots' conversion systems could further strengthen your enquiry journey,"
    },
    {
      "id": 20,
      "start": 133.66,
      "end": 139.78,
      "text": " helping venues respond faster, capture more opportunities, and improve follow-up consistency."
    },
    {
      "id": 21,
      "start": 141.42,
      "end": 142.92,
      "text": " And here's the reality."
    },
    {
      "id": 22,
      "start": 143.4,
      "end": 145.74,
      "text": " Most venues don't have a traffic problem."
    },
    {
      "id": 23,
      "start": 145.74,
      "end": 147.64,
      "text": " They have a conversion problem."
    },
    {
      "id": 24,
      "start": 148.04,
      "end": 156.4,
      "text": " It's not uncommon for wedding venues to lose between 30 and 50% of potential enquiries before a couple ever gets in touch."
    },
    {
      "id": 25,
      "start": 157.7,
      "end": 162.46,
      "text": " The good news is that once you can see those issues, you can start fixing them."
    },
    {
      "id": 26,
      "start": 163.82,
      "end": 166.74,
      "text": " But your website doesn't exist in isolation."
    },
    {
      "id": 27,
      "start": 166.74,
      "end": 170.66,
      "text": " Couples are comparing multiple venues before making a decision."
    },
    {
      "id": 28,
      "start": 172.22,
      "end": 174.3,
      "text": " Next, competitor intel."
    },
    {
      "id": 29,
      "start": 174.66,
      "end": 179.32,
      "text": " And how Studio AI shows you exactly where your venue stands against the competition."
    },
    {
      "id": 30,
      "start": 179.32,
      "end": 179.82,
      "text": " "
    },
